{{Image}}
'''Léon Marc Herminie Fairmaire''' (1820–1906), French entomologist.

* A specialist in Coleoptera.
* Wrote 450 scientific papers and other publications relating to Coleoptera.

{{Taxa authored}}
{{Eponyms}}
=={{int:Publications}}==
